<view class="page">
  <view class="title">人脸迎宾授权</view>
  <view class="desc">仅在您主动同意后，通过本页摄像头实时采集人脸特征，用于到店欢迎。不会打开相册或本地图片。可随时关闭并删除特征。</view>
  <camera
    a:if="{{cameraOn}}"
    id="faceCamera"
    device-position="front"
    class="camera"
    onError="onCameraError"
  ></camera>
  <view class="hint" a:if="{{cameraOn}}">请正对摄像头，光线充足，画面中仅您一人</view>
  <view class="actions">
    <button class="btn-primary" onTap="startCamera" a:if="{{!cameraOn}}" loading="{{openingCamera}}">打开摄像头采集</button>
    <button class="btn-primary" onTap="confirmConsent" a:if="{{cameraOn}}" disabled="{{capturing}}">拍照并授权</button>
    <button class="btn-ghost" onTap="cancel">取消</button>
  </view>
</view>
